* {{audio|en|en-au-home run.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|(baseball) four-base hit}}{{lb|en|baseball}} A four-base [[hit]], allowing the [[batter]] to circle the [[base]]s and reach home safely in one play without any errors being committed by the [[defensive]] [[team]].
#: {{syn|en|homer|longball}}
#: {{ux|en|The first baseman hit a '''home run''' to lead off the ninth.}}
# {{lb|en|figurative}} The portion of a journey that ends at home.
#: {{ux|en|I'm on the '''home run'''.}}
# {{lb|en|figurative}} A [[success]]; especially, a popular success.
#: {{ux|en|The product was a '''home run'''.}}
# {{lb|en|colloquial}} [[sexual intercourse|Sexual intercourse]].
# {{lb|en|electrical engineering}} A connection from a central distribution point or [[circuit breaker]] to a destination.

